        <activityName xml:lang="en">Urea formaldehyde foam, in situ foaming, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Urea formaldehyde foam, in situ foaming, at plant
Foam has a density of 10 - 30 kg /m3 and a thermal conductivity of 0.035 W/mK. Data is based on crude assumptions.;
UUID: 6d2ceb01-b971-397b-bb02-a5644d0125d2
Includes raw materials and in situ production of foam. Transports to application site are not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: On site production of foam from two components using a compressor and a portable injection device.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: none 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6d2ceb01-b971-397b-bb02-a5644d0125d2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
